'''Pokémon Tales: The Misadventures of Sirfetch'd & Pichu''' (Japanese: '''ポケモンテイルズ「ネギガナイトとピチューの{{ruby|冒険|ぼうけん}}」''' ''Pokémon Tales: The Adventures of {{tt|Negigaknight|Sirfetch'd}} & Pichu'') is a {{wp|Stop motion|stop-motion}} {{pkmn|animation|animated}} series created as a collaboration between British studio {{wp|Aardman Animation}} and [[The Pokémon Company International]]. It has been described as a "special project" scheduled to be released in 2027.

==History==
{{Bulbagarden|forum|pokemon-teases-a-collaboration-with-british-stop-motion-and-clay-animation-studio-aardman-set-to-release-in-2027.304439|Pokémon teases a collaboration with British stop motion and clay animation studio Aardman, set to release in 2027}}
The collaboration was announced on December 11, 2024 with a teaser short released alongside the announcement.<ref>''[https://www.aardman.com/latest-news/2024/december/pokemon-aardman-team-up-for-exciting-collaboration-coming-2027/ Pokémon & Aardman team up for exciting collaboration coming 2027]'' (2024, December 11). Aardman. Retrieved April 26, 2025.</ref><ref>''[https://press.pokemon.com/en/releases/Pokemon-Aardman-Team-Up-for-Exciting-Collaboration-Coming-2027 Pokémon & Aardman Team Up for Exciting Collaboration Coming 2027!]'' (2024, December 11). The Pokémon Company North America Official Press Site. Retrieved April 26, 2025.</ref> On July 22, 2025, a sneak peek trailer announcing the project's title was shown via [[Pokémon Presents#July 22, 2025|Pokémon Presents]].

